From 0cde38fa493d0bcd1a145f63e4fb7a444bba999d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ubuntu <ubuntu@ip-172-31-15-227.ca-central-1.compute.internal>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 16:13:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] feat(seahorse): semantic memory integration (M2)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Integrate pkg/embeddings into the seahorse context manager:

- Config: enableSemantic, embeddingEndpoint (base URL or full /embeddings
  path), embeddingModel, embeddingDim, topK, minScore, asyncWrite,
  ignoreSessionsForEmbedding. Off by default; ValidateSemantic guards.
- SemanticEngine (semantic.go): embeddings client + vector store
  (message_embeddings table, FK cascade via _pragma=foreign_keys(1)) +
  in-memory flat index loaded at startup. Async non-blocking Enqueue on
  Ingest, PendingIDs-driven Backfill that resumes across restarts,
  Close drains the worker. Failures log-and-drop (grep-only fallback).
- Retrieval: Semantic(ctx, SemanticInput) embeds query, nearest-neighbor
  search, returns GrepResult-shaped hits with cosine rank. Supports
  allConversations (default true) and conversation scoping.
- Tool: short_semantic — keyword-free memory recall, scopes to current
  session when all_conversations=false via tools.ToolSessionKey(ctx).
- Agent wiring: context_seahorse.go parses context_manager_config
  (was ignored), registers short_semantic when enabled, starts
  background backfill (2s delay, 45min cap).

Tests: 11 new semantic tests (fake embed server, async ingest+search,
tool+expand roundtrip, backfill idempotence, conversation scoping,
endpoint normalization, DSN). go test + race clean.
